Hello -

We are going to move the MPTCP Linux mailing list to the new =

lists.linux.dev infrastructure [1] hosted by the Linux Foundation. This =

will provide much better archiving and search, fewer delivery quirks, and =

(hopefully) improved spam filtering compared to the lists.01.org server.

The new URLs and address aren't set yet, but I expect to have that =

information to share in the next several days.

Archives will be hosted at https://lore.kernel.org, including complete =

message history from mptcp(a)lists.01.org

I plan to move all existing subscribers to the new list. If you would like =

to opt out, please reply to me off-list. You will also be able to easily =

unsubscribe from the new list.


When the new list is available I will post an introduction there, update =

the kernel MAINTAINERS file, and reconfigure mptcp(a)lists.01.org to steer =

people to the new list location.


[1] https://www.kernel.org/lists-linux-dev.html

